BoBot 🤖
An Expressive Desktop Companion Robot
BoBot is a personal engineering project built around the ESP32-C3 microcontroller. It brings a small desktop companion to life through animated OLED expressions, physical button interactions, a timer, and sound effects.

Features
* Animated facial expressions on an OLED display
* Physical button interactions
* Built-in timer mode
* Passive buzzer for sound effects

Hardware
* ESP32-C3 SuperMini
* 1.3-inch OLED display
* Two touch buttons
* Passive buzzer
* 3.7V LiPo battery

Technologies
* Embedded C++
* Arduino
* ESP32
* Electronics prototyping
* KiCad PCB design (planned)

Future Development
* Custom-designed PCB
* 3D-printed enclosure
* Servo-controlled head movement
* More expressions and interactions

About:BoBot is an ongoing engineering project exploring embedded systems, robotics, and human-machine interaction through hands-on experimentation.
